# Server-side only. Set these on the Vercel project, never in a committed file. Redeploy after changing them.
# Signs the session and challenge cookies. Any long random string, 32 bytes or more. Without it, real wallets stay off.
SEAL_SESSION_SECRET=
# Xaman developer console (https://apps.xumm.dev): API key and secret. Used to create and read sign-in and payment requests.
XAMAN_API_KEY=
XAMAN_API_SECRET=
# "on" lets the app run inside Xaman as an xApp, from /xapp. Anything else and those routes don't exist.
# SEAL_XAPP=
# Reown (https://dashboard.reown.com) project id, for the Joey phone app over WalletConnect. The Joey extension doesn't need it.
# Public by nature; the sheet reads it at run time. Add this site's domain to the project's allowed domains.
REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
# Postgres for the log, one-time sign-in ids and shipping addresses, with real rails on. PlanetScale's PgBouncer URL: port 6432
# and sslmode=verify-full. Anything else is refused, except plain TCP to localhost for tests.
DATABASE_URL=
# Comma-separated machine codes that can be bought. The shelf shows only these. Empty shows every live machine and, on mainnet, sells none of them.
SEAL_MACHINE_CODES=

# Token prizes. Unset pays half XRP, half SEAL. "off" pays any SEAL row in XRP at its value, in seasons already open too; prizes already struck stay SEAL. The SEAL issuer is fixed in code on mainnet.
# SEAL_TOKEN_PRIZES=off
# Testnet only: a stand-in issuer for SEAL.
# SEAL_TOKEN_ISSUER=
# Where the low SEAL float alert posts. Optional; it always shows on /admin.
# SEAL_ALERT_WEBHOOK=

# Where orders are refused, from our host's location headers. Comma-separated ISO 3166 codes, CU or UA-43. Unset is the default:
# CU, IR, KP, SY and the Crimea, Sevastopol, Donetsk and Luhansk regions. A missing location is allowed and logged.
# SEAL_RESTRICTED_PLACES=
# This site's own address: the Xaman return URL, metadata and mirrors. 02-env.mjs sets it to https://breaktheseal.rip.
# SEAL_PUBLIC_ORIGIN=

# Several packs in one order. Off unless SEAL_MULTI_QTY is exactly "on".
# SEAL_MULTI_QTY=on
# Most NFT packs in one order, 1 to 20. Unset is 3. Stock and treasury cover can make it lower.
# SEAL_MULTI_MAX=3
# Most card packs in one order, 1 to 20. Unset is 1, which means no picker. Custody's USDC can make it lower.
# SEAL_MULTI_CARD_MAX=1
